<item name='HelpECategories'><text>2. Database Custodian Guide</text></item>
<item name='HelpESubCat'><text>Customizing the Application</text></item>
<item name='HelpFCategories'><text>2. Guide de gardien de base de données</text></item>
<item name='HelpFSubCat'><text>Customizing the Application</text></item>
<item name='HelpDocNumber'><number>8</number></item>
<item name='HelpSubCatNumber'><number>2</number></item>
<item name='HelpEHelpText'><richtext>
<pardef id='1' leftmargin='0.8125in' rightmargin='73%'/>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>Occasionally, while doing an audit of the financial standing of a project, you may notice a discrepancy between the amount you see committed in the Project (Admin &gt; Project) compared to what you see in the Project viewed from the main navigator.</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>For an order to be added to the committed total, the "Got it" button must be pushed by the Admin person.  This will also result in a green check mark beside an order when viewed through the Project view from the main navigator.</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<pardef id='2' leftmargin='1.5000in' rightmargin='73%'/>
